  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo Tcnico al Clima de Inversiones y Adaptacin al Libre Comercio</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Climate and Trade Adjustment Technical Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El proposito del proyecto es apoyar la agenda gubernamental en estabilidad macroeconmica y reformas institucionales para enfrentar los ajustes al tratado de libre comercio.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to advance the Government&apos;s reform agenda to support macroeconomic stability and institutional reforms to assist in the adjustment to free trade.</narrative>
  </description>
